&lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Data Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the data architecture for a federal modernization initiative supporting permitting and natural resource management systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Architect will define and guide implementation of a modern AWS lakehouse that consolidates structured, document, geospatial, and event-driven data from multiple source systems into a governed canonical model. The role will establish architectural patterns for metadata-driven and agentic data engineering, data quality, document processing, GIS integration, and governed data products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The environment includes Amazon S3, Apache Iceberg, AWS Glue Catalog, DuckDB, Kafka/Amazon MSK, OpenSearch, GeoParquet, and PostGIS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is remote with periodic travel as required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary architecture authority for the data workstream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the end-to-end data architecture spanning ingestion, bronze/silver/gold processing, document pipelines, GIS processing, analytical data products, and downstream services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the lakehouse architecture using Amazon S3, Apache Iceberg, AWS Glue Catalog, and DuckDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define reusable patterns for batch, API, file, database, CDC, and event-driven ingestion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a metadata-driven architecture that supports configuration-based source onboarding and source-to-canonical mappings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and govern the common canonical data model used to harmonize information across source systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish data contracts and standards for lineage, provenance, reconciliation, schema evolution, auditability, and data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define architecture patterns for agentic solutions supporting source analysis, mapping, pipeline generation, testing, reconciliation, and quality assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish controls for agentic workflows, including validation, observability, security, deterministic execution, and human review where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate architecture across structured data, OCR/document processing, vector search, and geospatial data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide architectural direction and design review across the data engineering, data science, GIS, and content pipeline teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Government stakeholders and technical teams to translate business and domain requirements into scalable data models and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain architecture standards, technical decisions, interface specifications, and implementation guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support technical handoff and knowledge transfer to Government and operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Data Engineering, Information Systems, Engineering, or a related technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in data architecture, data engineering, or software engineering, including leadership of modern data platform initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing cloud-based data lakehouse or analytical platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;DuckDB, Apache Iceberg, SQL, Python, and AWS data services including Amazon S3 and AWS Glue&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing medallion-style architectures, canonical data models, and metadata-driven ingestion and transformation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating databases, APIs, files, streaming/event sources, and enterprise SaaS applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting or implementing &lt;strong&gt;agentic or AI-enabled solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, including orchestration, tool integration, validation, observability, security, and human-in-the-loop controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data contracts, schema evolution, lineage, provenance, reconciliation, and data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience providing architectural leadership to multidisciplinary technical teams and translating business requirements into scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kafka or Amazon MSK and CDC architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OpenSearch, vector databases, embeddings, or document retrieval systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agentic frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, or similar orchestration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing geospatial data architectures using GeoParquet and PostGIS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce, ServiceNow, Microsoft Dataverse, or similar enterprise platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in the &lt;strong&gt;U.S. Federal Government space&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with permitting, land management, environmental, energy, or natural-resource datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
