&lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to support applied machine learning, natural language processing, AI evaluation, data quality, and analytical product development for a federal permitting modernization initiative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Scientist will work across structured and unstructured data, including public comments, permitting records, compliance information, documents, and geospatially linked datasets. A key focus of the role will be developing representative evaluation datasets and quantitative methods to measure the performance, reliability, and limitations of AI-enabled and agentic solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is remote.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop analytical and machine-learning approaches supporting permitting and natural-resource use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain labeled datasets, evaluation corpora, and benchmark datasets for AI-enabled services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define quantitative evaluation methodologies for classification, extraction, retrieval, summarization, entity matching, and other AI/NLP capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate &lt;strong&gt;LLM and agentic workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, including output quality, retrieval performance, task completion, failure modes, and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze public-comment datasets and develop reusable features and evaluation datasets for comment-processing services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply NLP and machine-learning techniques to structured and unstructured data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate embedding models, semantic retrieval strategies, document-ranking techniques, and AI-generated outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop statistical approaches for detecting anomalies, reconciliation issues, missing data, and inconsistent records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Content Pipeline Engineers to measure OCR, extraction, and document-retrieval performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data Engineers to ensure analytical datasets and evaluation pipelines are reproducible and production-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support entity matching and harmonization across data originating in multiple source systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experiments and validation approaches with clearly defined success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to certified analytical data products, metrics, and governed datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reproducible Python analyses, models, evaluation pipelines, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate model performance, limitations, uncertainty, and failure modes to technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Data Science, Statistics, Computer Science, Mathematics, Engineering, or a related quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of relevant data science, applied machine learning, or quantitative analytics experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and SQL skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with statistical analysis, machine learning, NLP, and unstructured text data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing labeled datasets, benchmark datasets, and train/test evaluation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating &lt;strong&gt;LLM, RAG, or agentic AI solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, including retrieval quality, output accuracy, and failure modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of model-evaluation techniques, including precision, recall, F1, ranking metrics, confusion matrices, and related measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with embeddings, semantic retrieval, or vector-based search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing reproducible analytical and evaluation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to distinguish data-quality issues from model-performance issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to communicate analytical results, limitations, and uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agent evaluation frameworks or LLM observability tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;agentic frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, or similar orchestration frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OpenSearch, vector databases, or enterprise search platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with document AI or OCR pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with geospatial analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing entity-resolution, record-linkage, or data-quality models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in the &lt;strong&gt;U.S. Federal Government space&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with permitting, regulatory, environmental, energy, or natural-resource datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits and Salary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We attract the best people in the business with our competitive benefits package that includes medical, dental and vision coverage, 401k plan with employer contribution, paid holidays, vacation, and tuition reimbursement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy being a part of a high performing, professional service and technology focused organization, please apply today!&lt;/p&gt;

