&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead front-end architecture and implementation using&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Django, React&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Next.js&lt;/strong&gt;, JavaScript/TypeScript, HTML, and CSS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the &lt;strong&gt;adoption of the NCBI Web Design System&lt;/strong&gt;, including&amp;nbsp;component&amp;nbsp;strategy, implementation standards, documentation, reusable patterns, and best practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide integration with &lt;strong&gt;Headless CMS platforms&amp;nbsp;using&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Wagtail CMS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consume CMS-driven content through &lt;strong&gt;GraphQL&amp;nbsp;APIs&lt;/strong&gt;, REST APIs, or other structured content services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support front-end development within &lt;strong&gt;Django, React, and Next.js&amp;nbsp;based applications&lt;/strong&gt;, including templates and static asset workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead implementation of reusable UI components using the&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Web Design System&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish front-end coding standards, component patterns, documentation, and review processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor front-end developers and provide technical guidance across projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with UX, design, content, backend, CMS, DevOps, product, and stakeholder teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions meet accessibility, performance, SEO, scalability, and maintainability goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Support troubleshooting, testing, deployment, release planning, and production support.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
