&lt;li&gt;BS in Computer Science&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of Full stack Web applications development, using &lt;strong&gt;Django, React, and Next.js.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;Django, React&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Next.js&lt;/strong&gt;, JavaScript/TypeScript, HTML, and CSS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven front-end technical leadership experience on web platform projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing, extending, or supporting adoption of a &lt;strong&gt;Web Design System&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;across teams or products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
