&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Black Canyon Consulting (BCC)&lt;/strong&gt; is seeking a detail-oriented, proactive &lt;strong&gt;HR Administrative Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to support the day-to-day operations of our Human Resources department. This position reports directly to the Director of Human Resources and plays an important role in ensuring that HR processes are completed accurately, efficiently, and on time.&lt;/p&gt;
