&lt;li&gt;Monitor and manage the HR email inbox, respond to routine employee inquiries, and identify matters requiring escalation to HR leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track outstanding employee paperwork, approvals, acknowledgments, and other HR-related requests, proactively following up to ensure timely completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and distribute HR correspondence, including offer letters, employment verification letters, and other employee documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist employees with routine questions regarding company policies, benefits, payroll, and HR procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the administration and documentation of employee performance management processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain confidentiality when handling sensitive employee and company information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiting &amp;amp; Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
