&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate candidate records and recruiting workflows within the applicant tracking system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the preparation of offer letters and coordination of pre-employment requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the onboarding process for new employees, including start dates, employment paperwork, background checks, benefits information, and system access requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track onboarding requirements and follow up with new hires, hiring managers, and internal stakeholders to ensure all activities are completed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with employee offboarding, including separation documentation, exit procedures, and coordination of equipment returns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Systems &amp;amp; Compliance Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate employee and independent contractor information within HR systems, including Paylocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enter and maintain 1099 contractor information and support related administrative processes.&lt;/li&gt;
