&lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Production Quality Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for establishing, maintaining, and improving the quality systems and production quality processes required for compliant medical device manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is quality-focused first, with primary responsibility for ensuring compliance with ISO 13485 and FDA QMSR requirements, while also supporting hands-on problem solving within production operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a practical, execution-oriented Quality Engineer who is comfortable working directly on the production floor, investigating issues, and driving them to resolution. While the role interfaces with manufacturing, engineering,&lt;strong&gt; and &lt;/strong&gt;supply chain, the core expectation is strong ownership of quality engineering responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Systems &amp;amp; Regulatory Compliance (Primary Responsibility)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, implement, and maintain quality system processes aligned with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISO 13485:2016&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FDA QMSR / 21 CFR Part 820&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author and maintain quality documentation, including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SOPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forms and records&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and maintain compliance of a predominantly electronic (paperless) QMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to good documentation practices (GDP) and 21 CFR Part 11 (as applicable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support annual FDA establishment registration and device listing activities; assist with preparation, maintenance, and coordination of regulatory submissions, including 510(k) support, technical file/design dossier support, and submission documentation coordination with Regulatory Affairs, as applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal audits and external audits (FDA, ISO certification, MDSAP readiness)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nonconformance, CAPA &amp;amp; Issue Resolution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate nonconforming product and process deviations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support CAPA activities, including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Root cause analysis (RCA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corrective and preventive actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectiveness verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support complaint investigations and ensure feedback into manufacturing and process control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive timely and complete resolution of quality events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Quality &amp;amp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Problem Solving&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with production and technicians to:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate product and process issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify sources of variation and failure modes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement corrective actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure production processes meet defined quality requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support real-time decision-making on product disposition and quality concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and escalate risks to product quality or regulatory compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role requires a “get your hands dirty” mindset, including active engagement in troubleshooting and issue resolution on the production floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Validation &amp;amp; Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, execute, and maintain:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IQ/OQ/PQ validation activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support process changes and assess validation impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure processes remain in a validated state&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development and maintenance of control plans and process monitoring methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support risk management activities aligned with ISO 14971&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process FMEA (PFMEA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk assessment for manufacturing and process changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure risk-based decision making in quality and production activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Quality (Supporting Role)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support incoming inspection processes and acceptance criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in supplier issue investigations and corrective actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with supply chain and engineering to ensure material quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply Chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory / Quality teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide quality input on:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product performance issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support design transfer and production readiness as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Quality &amp;amp; Material Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support &lt;strong&gt;supplier selection, qualification, and evaluation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee &lt;strong&gt;incoming inspection and acceptance criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in supplier audits and drive supplier corrective actions as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure material quality supports consistent production outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Workforce Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and support technicians performing assembly, testing, and inspection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop training materials and ensure &lt;strong&gt;competency and training effectiveness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote best practices in documentation, quality, and process adherence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits and Salary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We attract the best people in the business with our competitive benefits package that includes medical, dental and vision coverage, 401k plan with employer contribution, paid holidays, vacation, and tuition reimbursement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy being a part of a high performing, professional service and technology focused organization, please apply today!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Canyon Consulting (BCC) is a premium provider for life sciences, project and program management. We are searching for a Product Manager&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to support our work with a renowned federal agency where you will help drive modernization in one of the world’s largest data repositories.&amp;nbsp;We are looking for full-time candidates currently residing in the United States. This position is available for remote work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Position Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dynamic Product Manager who will play a vital role in the success of the IT/Product Modernization for one of the largest public repositories of high-throughput data sequencing. The ideal candidate will guide product success, define vision, and prioritize government customer requirements. You will collaborate to meet contract deliverables and ensure customer satisfaction. In this role, you will work 50% with a Product Team and 50% with the Customer Experience/Stakeholder Engagement team. Working with the Product Team, you will ensure continued alignment of the software Product with the overall Product Modernization roadmap and provide transparent communication and management of the Product Roadmap. As part of the Customer Experience/Stakeholder Engagement team, you will conduct customer outreach, analyze market trends, conduct competitive analysis, and develop strategies to increase SRA platform usage. Strong leadership, excellent communication, and understanding of government clients are essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of an organization that operates within the intersection of technology and health, please apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand goals and outcomes for this highly visible data sequencing initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Customer Experience team and incorporate learnings from outreach into SRA Product Roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product roadmap to meet milestones and timelines to stay aligned with high-visibility deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate sprint planning and backlog grooming activities within the product team in order to drive timely product releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and review product requirements documents, establish success criteria, and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct user research to gather insights on user needs and preferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market research, audit current assets and their impact, competitor analysis, and distill that into insights that inform strategy and decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compile findings into actionable requirements for the product roadmap in collaboration with product owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize product releases properly and ensure compliance with the schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of risk assessments and risk mitigation countermeasures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compile findings into actionable requirements for the updated data model development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize requirements based on business goals and user needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the impact of the initiative on users’ sentiment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan outreach activities to engage stakeholders and users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-team collaboration amongst multiple product/development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Education and Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in software product management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience with Jira and agile methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing KPIs, executive reporting, and stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Excel and PowerPoint, MURAL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leading strategy and discovery sessions with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to synthesize complex data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a relevant field; advanced degree desired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified candidates will have some combination of these certifications:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Management certifications and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SAFe Agilist (SA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with genetic and biological DNA sequencing data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with NGS computational tools and formats (BWA, GATK, Galaxy, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Benefits and Salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We attract the best people in the business with our competitive benefits package that includes medical, dental and vision coverage, 401k plan with employer contribution, paid holidays, vacation, and tuition reimbursement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive salary commensurate with experience and location.&amp;nbsp;If you enjoy being a part of a high-performing, professional service and technology-focused organization, please apply today!&lt;/p&gt;

