&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Canyon Consulting (BCC) is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Scientific User Engagement Expert&lt;/strong&gt; to support the modernization of one of the world’s largest public repositories of high-throughput sequencing data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will focus on engaging researchers, data submitters, developers, and other technical users by developing and leading collaborative activities such as webinars, workshops, codeathons, scientific forums, and conferences. The successful candidate will help organize participation, collaborate with subject-matter experts, capture key outcomes, and support the development of user guidance and technical materials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will work closely with government leads, product teams, technical teams, and scientific subject-matter experts. It will coordinate collaborative content development by gathering expert input, organizing contributions, editing materials, and moving deliverables through review. The individual must also be prepared to draft or revise content when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of an organization that operates within the intersection of technology and health, please apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key topics and other opportunities for educating the genomics community on best practices to maximize their experience when using the Sequence Read Archive (SRA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, develop, and coordinate scientific user engagement activities such as workshops, classes, codeathons, webinars, scientific forums, and other collaborative events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify appropriate user groups, communities, use cases, and participation needs. Coordinate participation by researchers, data submitters, developers, institutional partners, and technical experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop documentation such as marketing copies to advertise events, agendas, briefing materials, workshop materials such as application-based exercises, demos, jupyter notebooks, presentations, manuscripts for peer-reviewed publications, technical and help documentation, DIY(short) instructional videos and post-event summaries and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture key discussions, decisions, technical findings, and follow-up actions and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support government leads and subject-matter experts during scientific and technical engagement activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the development of user guidance, training resources, reports, technical documentation, abstracts, and presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize collaborative authoring and review processes, including contributor coordination, comment resolution, and deadline management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft or revise materials when needed, with appropriate subject-matter expert review and government approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track participation, satisfaction, adoption, and other indicators of engagement effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that relevant user observations and event outcomes are communicated to product and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Education and Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a scientific, technical, education, user engagement, or related field; advanced degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least three years of experience in a user-facing setting for scientific engagement, user education, workshop facilitation, technical coordination, or a related area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience planning and facilitating workshops, hackathons, webinars, conferences, or collaborative scientific events that are driven by community needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong facilitation, presentation, writing, editing, and project coordination skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex scientific and technical topics and make them accessible to different user groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating input from multiple subject-matter experts and contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage competing priorities, scope changes, deadlines, and review cycles in a collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and understanding of community needs in genomics, bioinformatics, biomedical research, scientific data platforms, or government programs is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Benefits and Salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We attract the best people in the business with our competitive benefits package that includes medical, dental and vision coverage, 401k plan with employer contribution, paid holidays, vacation, and tuition reimbursement.&amp;nbsp;We offer a competitive salary commensurate with experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy being a part of a high performing, professional service and technology focused organization, please apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LOCATION: Bethesda, Maryland &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;(On-site / Not-remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced AI/LLM Engineer to lead the design, customization, and integration of large language models (LLMs) into biomedical research workflows and information retrieval systems. We are looking for someone with hands-on experience training, fine-tuning, augmenting, and deploying LLMs in production environments, ideally within biomedical or life sciences domains. The role is product-oriented and forward-looking, focused on building the next generation of AI-enabled search, retrieval, and knowledge discovery tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role serves as a subject matter expert (SME) across multiple product and engineering teams. The selected candidate will help define, architect, and implement LLM-driven capabilities across a portfolio of NCBI services. The position requires strong technical depth, sound architectural judgment, and the ability to collaborate effectively within existing product and technical ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, build-oriented role with strategic influence. The candidate must be capable of guiding both what gets built and how it gets built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only serious candidates accepted - &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;we are not seeking candidates that have recently graduated with a masters degree in the past 1-2 years&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking candidates with at least 3+ years experience doing this work after your last degree.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the AI/LLM subject matter expert across product and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers and technical leads to define AI-enabled capabilities and define the use of LLMs across NCBI platforms (e.g., PubMed and related systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems integrating LLMs with large-scale biomedical datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide architectural guidance on model selection, domain adaptation, evaluation strategies, and deployment approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve model grounding, factual accuracy, and scientific reliability in domain-sensitive applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support engineering teams in productionizing AI solutions, ensuring scalability, performance, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging LLM techniques and recommend practical adoption strategies aligned with organizational priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of hands-on experience working with large language models (training, fine-tuning, augmentation, or deployment).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience integrating LLMs into production systems (e.g., semantic search, RAG pipelines, domain-specific QA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in ML system architecture and scalable deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work cross-functionally with product and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience serving as a technical SME guiding multi-team initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern ML frameworks (e.g., PyTorch, Hugging Face) and retrieval infrastructure (e.g., embeddings, vector databases).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building LLM-based systems for biomedical research or life sciences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with large scientific corpora, biomedical ontologies, structured knowledge bases, or biological datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing generative AI systems for DNA, RNA, or protein sequence analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in bioinformatics, computational biology, or related disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving factual grounding and reducing hallucinations in scientific or regulated environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically deep in LLM training, augmentation, and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable influencing architecture across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to move between strategy, design, and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic and product-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of integrating into existing systems and elevating technical execution immediately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with life sciences corpora.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Benefits and Salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We attract the best people in the business with our competitive benefits package that includes medical, dental and vision coverage, 401k plan with employer contribution, paid holidays, vacation, and tuition reimbursement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive salary commensurate with experience and location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy being a part of a high performing, professional service and technology focused organization, please apply today!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Canyon Consulting (BCC) is searching for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Business Intelligence Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the design, development, implementation, and enhancement of enterprise business intelligence solutions. The Senior Business Intelligence Analyst will use Microsoft Power BI and related technologies to transform complex data into actionable insights that support strategic and operational decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Business Intelligence Analyst will serve as a technical expert responsible for leading complex business intelligence and data analytics initiatives. This position will design and develop advanced reporting, dashboards, data models, and analytical solutions using Microsoft Power BI, Power Query, DAX, and related Microsoft technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Business Intelligence Analyst will analyze complex datasets, identify patterns and trends, develop innovative analytical approaches, and translate findings into meaningful business insights. This position will also evaluate solution performance, recommend improvements, and provide technical leadership across multiple assignments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires experience applying artificial intelligence technologies to analytics, business intelligence, or related data initiatives and the ability to identify opportunities where AI can enhance analytical capabilities and decision support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant professional experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of experience related to artificial intelligence technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience designing, developing, implementing, and maintaining business intelligence solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced experience with Microsoft Power BI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced experience with Power Query&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced experience developing DAX calculations and measures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing complex dashboards, reports, and data visualizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data modeling and business intelligence architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience analyzing complex datasets and identifying meaningful patterns, trends, and relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating business requirements into analytical and reporting solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating business intelligence solution performance and recommending improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop analytical methodologies that produce actionable business insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience serving as a technical expert across multiple projects or initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and data interpretation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate complex analytical findings to technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Desired Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AI or machine learning capabilities into business intelligence or analytics solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Fabric or other Microsoft data and analytics technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with advanced data modeling and semantic models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large or complex enterprise datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing executive dashboards and decision-support tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing business intelligence standards, governance, or development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring or providing technical guidance to analysts or developers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL, data warehouses, data lakes, or similar data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise-wide analytics initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing organizational strategy through data-driven analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, development, implementation, and maintenance of business intelligence solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop advanced reports, dashboards, data models, and visualizations using Microsoft Power BI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize Power Query transformations and DAX calculations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business and organizational requirements into effective analytical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze complex datasets to identify patterns, trends, relationships, and actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop innovative analytical methodologies and approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI technologies where appropriate to enhance analytics and business intelligence capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate business intelligence solution performance and identify opportunities for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend significant technical or analytical changes that support project and organizational objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a technical expert across multiple business intelligence and analytics initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership and guidance related to business intelligence technologies and practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data-driven insights that support strategic and operational decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business stakeholders, technical teams, analysts, and organizational leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure analytical solutions are accurate, reliable, maintainable, and aligned with organizational requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of business intelligence standards, methodologies, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging business intelligence, analytics, and AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future direction of organizational business intelligence capabilities and practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate analytical findings and recommendations to leadership and other stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits and Salary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We attract the best people in the business with our competitive benefits package that includes medical, dental and vision coverage, 401k plan with employer contribution, paid holidays, vacation, and tuition reimbursement.&lt;/p&gt;
