&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Canyon Consulting &lt;strong&gt;(BCC)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is actively looking for&lt;strong&gt; Senior Linux System Administrator&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to support our work for the National Center for Biotechnology Information (NCBI) at the National Library of Medicine (NLM), an institute of the National Institutes of Health.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;c-message__edited_label&quot;&gt;This opportunity is full time and onsite at the NIH-NCBI in Bethesda, MD.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NCBI is part of the National Library of Medicine (NLM) at&amp;nbsp;the National Institutes of Health (NIH).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NCBI&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the world’s premier biomedical center hosting over six million daily users that seek research, clinical, genetic, and other information that directly impacts biomedical research and public health – at NCBI you can literally help to accelerate cures for diseases!&amp;nbsp;NCBI’s wide range of applications, platforms (node, python, Django, C++, you name it) and environments (big data [petabytes], machine learning, multiple clouds) serve more users than almost any other US Government Agency according to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://analytics.usa.gov/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://analytics.usa.gov/&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;span class=&quot;c-message__edited_label&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We attract the best people in the business with our competitive benefits package that includes medical, dental and vision coverage, 401k plan with employer contribution, paid holidays, vacation, and tuition reimbursement. If you enjoy being a part of a high performing, professional service and technology focused organization, please apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Develop and document standard operating procedures for a wide range of tasks, such as systems provisioning, installation, upgrading, and migration; host and service monitoring; configuration management; problem troubleshooting; and other aspect of systems administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Manage and configure services, software, and hardware configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Take direction from the team lead and work independently within a team-environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Mentor junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Learn new technologies and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain custom tools in Python, Perl, Ruby, and Bash to automate managing the UNIX infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Use Puppet to maintain thousands of physical and virtual Linux CentOS systems and associated applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Develop policies and procedures for standard systems administration tasks (packaging, OS installs, patch management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Build open-source software from source code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Document procedures, systems, services, and software. Provide ad-hoc training where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Provide UNIX support to NCBI&#39;s internal developers and researchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Provide technical solutions to a wide range of problems and user requests through an established trouble ticketing system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot, research, design, and implement solutions to complex systems problems while accounting for technical limits, overall cost, and security policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot;&gt;Assist with planning and implementation of major OS upgrade, deployments, and architectural changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn new technologies and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate significant experience in Linux Systems Administration (7+ years).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with Unix command line tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly versed in Linux administration and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in programming/scripting skills for automation in at least two of Bash, Ruby, Python, and Perl. (Other languages also helpful, but not required.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General understanding of Linux internals (system calls, file systems, processes, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General understanding of TCP/IP and related protocols (HTTP, FTP, NFS, etc…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with users of varying levels of IT knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with building open-source software from source code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work with minimum supervision on assigned tasks, and work with others both within and outside of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, especially with regards to documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points (not required!):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a complex, dynamic, production, public-facing Linux environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OpenShift, Kubernetes, GKE, or similar technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cloud technology such as AWS and GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated configuration management, such as Puppet (preferred), Ansible, Chef, bcfg2, CFEngine, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with version control. (Git is preferred, but not required.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting large web application environments and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise network architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with monitoring, alerting, and observability tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Canyon Consulting &lt;strong&gt;(BCC)&lt;/strong&gt; is searching for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Network Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to support our work for the National Center for Biotechnology Information (NCBI) at the National Library of Medicine (NLM), an institute of the National Institutes of Health. &lt;span class=&quot;c-message__edited_label&quot;&gt;This opportunity is full time and onsite at the NIH-NCBI in Bethesda, MD with option for some remote work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Network Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with a passion for designing and deploying high-performance networks. If you have deep expertise with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Arista EOS and CloudVision&lt;/strong&gt;, and a proven track record of modernizing legacy infrastructure, you&#39;re exactly who we&#39;re looking for. In this role, you won&#39;t just maintain networks; you&#39;ll be a team leader, driving innovation and shaping our network architecture. You&#39;ll work with the latest technologies like &lt;strong&gt;Spine-and-Leaf, VxLAN, EVPN, and BGP&lt;/strong&gt;, and use your scripting&amp;nbsp;skills to automate everything you can.&amp;nbsp;This is your chance to be a key contributor to a critical scientific mission to improve health and advance medical breakthroughs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement cutting-edge, high-performance network architectures, with a focus on Spine-and-Leaf designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your deep knowledge of Arista&#39;s Extensible Operating System (EOS) and CloudVision platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and maintain F5 BIG-IP platforms, including virtual servers, pools, and iRules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Python and other Linux tools to automate network management and streamline operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a team leader, mentoring and managing team members, handling complex issues, and serving as a subject matter expert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve our legacy networks for hybrid and cloud-native environments and provide expert support to resolve complex network issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement load balancing strategies (e.g., round robin, least connections) to optimize application performance and ensure high availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and manage Arista and F5 device clusters in active/standby or active/active configurations to provide failover capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong knowledge of AAA frameworks for network access control. Hands-on experience configuring and managing &lt;strong&gt;TACACS+, Radius&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for device administration security in Cisco ICE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for all network device patching, including security fixes and OS updates. Track device vendor support timelines and manage end of life transitions to updated hardware models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor network traffic and alerts for proactive management and capacity planning. Provide up to date network metrics to all technical teams for better product development and troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of hands-on experience in network engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A CCIE or similar advanced networking certification is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Arista EOS/CloudVision&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;F5 BIG-IP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in protocols like&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;BGP, OSPF, VxLAN, and EVPN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Python scripting&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and network automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to work independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Benefits and Salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We attract the best people in the business with our competitive benefits package that includes medical, dental and vision coverage, 401k plan with employer contribution, paid holidays, vacation, and tuition reimbursement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive salary commensurate with experience and location. The targeted range for this position is $110,000 - $160,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy being a part of a high performing, professional service and technology focused organization, please apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Canyon Consulting &lt;strong&gt;(BCC)&lt;/strong&gt; is searching for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Network Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to support our work for the National Center for Biotechnology Information (NCBI) at the National Library of Medicine (NLM), an institute of the National Institutes of Health. &lt;span class=&quot;c-message__edited_label&quot;&gt;This opportunity is full time and onsite at the NIH-NCBI in Bethesda, MD with option for some remote work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to build the future of hybrid onprem and cloud networking? We&#39;re seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Network Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with a passion for designing and deploying high-performance networks. If you have deep expertise with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AF5 LTM and GTM, BGP and OSPF routing protocol, Arista EOS and CloudVision&lt;/strong&gt;, and a proven track record of modernizing legacy infrastructure, you&#39;re exactly who we&#39;re looking for.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you won&#39;t just maintain networks; you&#39;ll be a technical leader, driving innovation and shaping our network architecture. You&#39;ll work with the latest technologies like&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Spine-and-Leaf, VxLAN, EVPN, and BGP&lt;/strong&gt;, and use your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Python scripting&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;skills to automate everything you can.&amp;nbsp;This is your chance to be a key contributor to a critical scientific mission to improve health and advance medical breakthroughs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect and Deploy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Design and implement cutting-edge, high-performance network architectures, with a focus on Spine-and-Leaf designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Arista:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Leverage your deep knowledge of Arista&#39;s Extensible Operating System (EOS) and CloudVision platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage F5:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Configure and maintain F5 BIG-IP platforms, including virtual servers, pools, and iRules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate Everything:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Use Python and other Linux tools to automate network management and streamline operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the Way:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Act as a technical leader, mentoring team members, handling complex issues, and serving as a subject matter expert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modernize and Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Evolve our legacy networks for cloud-native environments and provide expert support to resolve complex network issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Load Balanced Application Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Implement load balancing strategies (e.g., round robin, least connections) to optimize application performance and ensure high availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Availability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Setting up and manage Arista and F5 device clusters in active/standby or active/active configurations to provide failover capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AAA (Authentication, Authorization, and Accounting):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong knowledge of AAA&amp;nbsp;frameworks for network access control. Hands-on experience configuring and managing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;TACACS+, Radius&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for device administration security in Cisco ICE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Hardware Lifecycle Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Responsible for all network device patching, including security fixes and OS updates. Track device vendor support timelines and manage end of life transitions to updated hardware models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Monitor network traffic and alerts for proactive management and capacity planning. Provide up to date network metrics to all technical teams for better product development and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of hands-on experience in network engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A CCIE or similar advanced networking certification is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;Arista EOS/CloudVision&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;F5 BIG-IP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
