&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Canyon Consulting &lt;strong&gt;(BCC)&lt;/strong&gt; is searching for a&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to support the delivery and modernization of mission-critical, web-based digital resources for a federal government client. This role is responsible for guiding product strategy and execution across complex, data-driven systems that serve a broad and diverse user base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Product Manager will work closely with a Product Owner and lead collaboration across Engineering, User Experience (UX), Quality Assurance (QA), and client stakeholders to define priorities, refine the backlog, and deliver incremental product releases. This is a highly visible role requiring strong communication skills, strategic thinking, and the ability to execute tactically in a fast-paced Agile environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: large;&quot;&gt;Duties &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;StandardFullstackdeveloperpositiondescriptionSenior-JobResponsibilities&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Strategy and Customer Advocacy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional teams to define, prioritize, and deliver product features and enhancements aligned with business objectives, user needs, and technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply user research, usability findings, analytics, and stakeholder input to inform product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strong advocate for end users, ensuring their needs are clearly understood and reflected in product requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Business Analysts (BAs) to translate product vision and feature ideas into clear, actionable requirements, including user stories, acceptance criteria, and definitions of done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage prioritization within an evolving roadmap, balancing near-term delivery with long-term strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Delivery and Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Product Owner to support backlog refinement and prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work day-to-day with Agile teams (Engineering, UX, QA) to develop, iterate, and refine product capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in Agile ceremonies, including sprint planning, standups, reviews, and retrospectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor delivered functionality and quality, proactively identifying issues and driving resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment across internal teams and external stakeholders through clear communication and expectation management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roadmapping, Planning, and Risk Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain product roadmaps, timelines, and release plans aligned with stakeholder needs and program goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously assess risks related to scope, dependencies, technical feasibility, and resourcing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with leadership to identify and remove delivery barriers, including technical or process challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate across UX, Engineering, and Business teams to ensure appropriate staffing and sequencing of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Metrics, Outcomes, and Continuous Improvement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success metrics, Key Performance Indicators (KPIs), and outcomes to measure product effectiveness and user impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and feedback to guide continuous product improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure delivered solutions align with target architecture, technology strategy, and long-term maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote a culture of continuous improvement, learning, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;StandardFullstackdeveloperpositiondescriptionSenior-Desiredskillsandexperience&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Business, or a related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience supporting technical software or web-based product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience as a Product Manager or Product Owner for digital products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching multiple products or major features, including ongoing optimization and improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on large, cross-functional initiatives in complex, policy- or data-driven environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience using user research, customer feedback, and performance data to guide product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with distributed or remote teams is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;StandardFullstackdeveloperpositiondescriptionSenior-Requiredskillsandexperience&quot;&gt;Required skills and experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of human-centered design and its integration with Agile delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid working knowledge of software development lifecycles and Agile methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated thought leadership in modernizing digital products or platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, communication, and consensus-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to synthesize and reconcile competing priorities and stakeholder perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Jira and Confluence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clearance and Location Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Must be able to obtain and maintain a Public Trust clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Must reside in and be authorized to work in the United States;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;candidates in the DMV area preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;All work must be performed within the United States&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
