&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting current-state (“as-is”) process assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing future-state (“to-be”) workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience facilitating stakeholder interviews, discovery sessions, or workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing end-to-end process maps and identifying key handoffs, dependencies, and bottlenecks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify root causes of process inefficiencies, delays, redundant activities, and operational failures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing actionable process improvement recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating opportunities for automation, digital forms, workflow tools, or other technology-enabled improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating SOPs, workflow diagrams, roles and responsibility matrices, templates, job aids, and training materials&lt;/li&gt;
