&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Canyon Consulting (BCC) is searching for a &lt;strong&gt;Systems Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design, development, integration, and enhancement of enterprise systems using the Microsoft Power Platform and related technologies. The Systems Developer will work with technical teams and stakeholders to build scalable, reliable, and maintainable system-level solutions that align with enterprise architecture standards and evolving business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Systems Developer will design, develop, configure, and enhance system-level solutions using Microsoft Power Platform technologies, including Power Apps, Power Automate, Dataverse, connectors, and related tools. This position will support system architecture, data modeling, integration, and environment management activities that enable reliable enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Systems Developer will also analyze system behavior, troubleshoot technical issues, optimize performance, implement approved enhancements, and support system releases and production operations. The position requires close coordination with developers, architects, technical teams, and business stakeholders throughout the system lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, developing, and maintaining enterprise systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing solutions using Microsoft Power Platform technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Power Apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Power Automate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Microsoft Dataverse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience configuring and integrating connectors and external systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system architecture and system-level design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data modeling and application data structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing technical configurations and custom components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing or supporting system interfaces and integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting system issues and analyzing system behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience optimizing system performance and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop and maintain system design and integration documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of enterprise architecture standards and technical governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively with technical teams, stakeholders, and end users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Requirements by Level:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mid-Level:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
