&lt;li&gt;Experience developing system architecture and integration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting production Power Platform environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system monitoring, performance tuning, and troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
