&lt;li&gt;Research new technologies in pursuit of advancing the goals of the program and product line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct and coordinate the actions of the development team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership and guidance to the development team&lt;/li&gt;
