&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one programming language (Java, C, C++)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Cloud data storage and processing platforms (AWS, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one scripting language (BASH, Python)&lt;/li&gt;
