&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with common structured documents (XML, JSON, CSV)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines, unit tests, integration, and regression testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coaching team members&lt;/li&gt;
